    {
      "title": "Focusing ring",
      "text": "Turning it a quarter turn takes the focus from infinity in to 0.7 m, screwing the glass 4.5 mm forward. The rangefinder follows it through a cam on the back of the lens.",
      "node": "focus_ring",
      "position": [
        0.096,
